<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-2564] CPP: Memory reallocation callback doesn&apos;t work.</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-2564</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Steps to reproduce&lt;/b&gt;:&lt;br/&gt;
1) Start a CPP node.&lt;br/&gt;
2) Put large string to cache (say, &amp;gt;1024 chars long)&lt;br/&gt;
3) Now try to read this string using Cache.Get() method. PlatformNoCallbackException exception is thrown.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Root cause&lt;/b&gt;: &lt;br/&gt;
External memory reallocation callback is not set.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Solution&lt;/b&gt;:&lt;br/&gt;
Add memory reallocation callback to ignite_environment.cpp&lt;/p&gt;</description>
