                            <comment id="15134091" author="k100000" created="Fri, 5 Feb 2016 12:38:16 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Hi,&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Pls find attached the files I tested with in the &apos;example&apos; solution of cpp client. Just add trade.h to the header list &amp;amp; replace main with the one attached, it should be easy to replicate by passing different sizes in rand_alnum_str call of &apos;PutGetTrade&apos; method. &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Some details about env:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Windows 7  x64&lt;br/&gt;
Visual Studio 2010/2012  &lt;br/&gt;
jdk1.7.0_71 x64&lt;br/&gt;
JAVA_OPTS=-d64 -Xms16G -Xmx16G -XX:PermSize=512M -XX:MaxPermSize=1G -XX:MaxDirectMemorySize=512M&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I also replicated on 1.5b. &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Thanks and let me know if you need additional details.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Claudiu&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
